  "description": "Atomic and ephemeral coordination primitives for .NET: IReplayGuard (single-use claim / nonce protection), IRequestThrottle (atomic fixed-window rate limiting), and ISignalBroadcaster (ephemeral pub/sub signaling) over a pluggable backend, with a built-in in-memory default. CoordinationScope namespaces all coordination state per application/environment so multiple deployments can safely share one backend. Standalone and dependency-light (Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection.Abstractions only) — add Cirreum.Coordination.Redis for distributed, multi-instance coordination. Useful for replay/nonce protection, idempotency keys, message de-duplication, rate limiting, and cross-instance cache invalidation / notification signals.",
